Since values.tpl.yaml will no longer use these package version variables, remove them.
values_template_params = {
  # Must have at least one param here to ensure values.tpl.yaml will be used
  app             = local.params.app
  oidc_issuer_uri = "https://zilverton.oktapreview.com/oauth2/default"
}
Important

Do not remove values_template_params completely.
Your module logic in charts/locals.tf says:

use_values_template = length(var.helm_chart_values_template_params) > 0

So if you make it empty, Terraform may stop rendering charts/local/superset/values.tpl.yaml.

That means you still need at least one template parameter there.
In your case app and oidc_issuer_uri are still used in that template, so keep them.

