Files you do not need to change

You do not need to modify these for the image switch:

charts/main.tf
charts/locals.tf
charts/requisites/*
charts/requisites/scripts/configure-superset.sh

Why not:

charts/main.tf already passes Helm values correctly
charts/locals.tf already decides whether to use values.tpl.yaml
requisites are about secrets and setup, not container image build

So those files are fine as they are.

